# Biology 15 — Life cell complete aerobic oxidation usability
# Pure .cubalc science board: oxidise burns energy → floor((n*3)/4) atp (stronger than respire)
REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
INCLUDE life_cell
SCIENCE LOAD

SCENE dish
CUBE medium ROLE host PROTON 1
ENTITY seed OF Cell 1 24 0
PLUG medium seed
IMPULSE medium 1
ENERGYFLOW 2
FLOW 1

SEND seed oxidise 12
ASSERT LAST_N == 9 "oxidise 12 → atp 9"
GETF seed energy
ASSERT LAST_N == 12 "energy remainder 12"
GETF seed ready
ASSERT LAST_N == 1 "ready above threshold"
SEND seed total
ASSERT LAST_N == 21 "total 12+9"
SEND seed potential
ASSERT LAST_N == 30 "potential 12+18"
SEND seed nourish 3
ASSERT LAST_N == 15 "nourish tops energy"
GETF seed ready
ASSERT LAST_N == 1 "still ready"

PRINT "bio15_oxidise" ENERGY
PASS
